          "at": "2026-11-17T01:33:18.932Z",
          "html": "<p>\n  Found it. A project opened from the compile cache was first drawn from a parse of the file on its own, then redrawn\n  about 1.3s later from the project's parse. Now the lines stay hidden until the project's parse comes, so the first\n  drawing you see is the final one. Details:\n  <epic-link epic=\"language\" item=\"I148\"></epic-link>.\n</p>"
        }
      ],
